OL,3,ATurner Prize gallery 'centre of
OL,4,Acreative universe'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTurner Prize nominated artworks are
OL,7,Fgoing on display at a gallery in what
OL,8,Fits director has called a "prestigious
OL,9,Fopportunity".
OL,11,FWork by four artists in the running for
OL,12,Fthe prize - Simeon Barclay, Kira
OL,13,FFreije, Marguerite Humeau and Tanoa
OL,14,FSasraku - will go on display at
OL,15,FTeesside University's Middlesbrough
OL,16,FInstitute of Modern Art (MIMA) from 26
OL,17,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,167,160,200,105,0,100
