OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F166A1790344455
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATurner Prize gallery 'centre of
OL,4,Acreative universe'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Laura Sillars, director of MIMA and
OL,7,Fdean of culture and creativity at the
OL,8,Fniversity, said of the exhibition:
OL,9,F"While it's here, at a certain level,
OL,10,Fwe are the centre of the creative
OL,11,Funiverse."
OL,13,FThe Turner Prize is awarded each year
OL,14,Fto a British artist for an outstanding
OL,15,Fexhibition or other presentation of
OL,16,Ftheir work.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
